		<title type="html"><![CDATA[Assistant Professorship in Game Technology in Copenhagen]]></title>

		
		<content type="html" xml:base="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/viewtopic.php?p=17275#p17275"><![CDATA[
The IT University of Copenhagen announced a call for an Assistant Professorship in Game Technology<br>with an emphasis on physics/graphics. The candidate will be placed at the<br>center for computer games research (<a href="http://game.itu.dk/" class="postlink">http://game.itu.dk/</a>). Application deadline is March, 3.<br><br>ITU Vacancies list:<br><a href="http://www1.itu.dk/sw487.asp" class="postlink">http://www1.itu.dk/sw487.asp</a><br><br>Further information about the call can be found here:<br><br><a href="http://www1.itu.dk/graphics/ITU-library/Intranet/Personale/Stillingsopslag/VIP/Stillingsopslag%202010/2009-223-0011%20Assistant%20Professor%20201001.pdf" class="postlink">http://www1.itu.dk/graphics/ITU-library ... 201001.pdf</a><p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=418">jobs</a> — Tue Feb 02, 2010 7:08 pm</p><hr />
